Hi,

This version adds support for ESP SCSI controller (not the real, but Qemu 
one), Type 5 keyboard, and some more escape codes. Now Qemu can boot from a 
CD and one can use keyboard to select SILO options in graphical mode. I've 
also merged a patch from Debian.

